      "explanationHtml": "‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arcsin</annotation></semantics></math></span> מוגדרת ורציפה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,a]</annotation></semantics></math></span> וגזירה ב-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,a)</annotation></semantics></math></span> (כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a&lt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span>), והמנה היא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\arcsin a-0}{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin t</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותנת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\sin a}{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arcsin t-t</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותנת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\arcsin a}{a}-1</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>t</mi><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{t}{\\sqrt{1-t^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותנת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-a^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
