      "explanationHtml": "‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln1=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\ln x-\\ln1}{x-1}=\\frac{\\ln x}{x-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, והקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[1,x]</annotation></semantics></math></span> נמצא כולו בתחום של <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln</annotation></semantics></math></span>. ‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,x]</annotation></semantics></math></span> ו-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span> כוללים את <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span> שבו <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ln</annotation></semantics></math></span> לא מוגדרת. ‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[x,2x]</annotation></semantics></math></span> נותן את המנה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\ln2}{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span> (השונה מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\ln x}{x-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>).",
