       "explain": "‏$f'(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-t^2}}$, ולכן $f'\\left(\\frac35\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\frac9{25}}}=\\frac{1}{\\frac45}=\\frac54=1.25$.",
       "promptHtml": "עבור <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arcsin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(t)=\\arcsin t</annotation></semantics></math></span> בקטע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,a]</annotation></semantics></math></span>, כמה שווה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;\\left(\\frac35\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span> ? (עשרוני)",
       "explainHtml": "‏<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;(t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-t^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>25</mn></mfrac></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f&#x27;\\left(\\frac35\\right)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\frac9{25}}}=\\frac{1}{\\frac45}=\\frac54=1.25</annotation></semantics></math></span>."
